# Caches that the tools themselves write INSIDE a managed external. Without this,
# chezmoi sees drift, asks "has changed since chezmoi last wrote it?" and a
# non-interactive apply dies on "could not open a new TTY", taking the scripts
# with it. Nothing downstream of the prompt runs.
.oh-my-zsh/cache/**
.oh-my-zsh/log/**
.tmux/plugins/tpm/.git/**

